      "title_ru": "Игумен всея Руси, всея России чудотворец",
      "color": "blue",
      "rank": "feast",
      "nationality": "ru",
      "quote": "«Behold, love one another, and hold fast to peace and unity in the Holy Trinity, for without love all works are vanity.»",
